# Enforce Unix line endings (LF) for APEXlang and SQL files
*.apx text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf

# Enforce LF on scripts so a CRLF checkout (e.g. Windows core.autocrlf=true)
# never breaks a bash shebang for Linux/macOS collaborators. PowerShell reads
# either line ending fine, so pinning .ps1 to LF too is just for consistency.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
